        "topFinding": "Cattery's health dropped 80 to 70 this run, the sharpest move of either project today, and it is real signal rather than noise: three lenses this run corrected scores that had been standing on stale assumptions. Discord release-notify has never been wired since v0.1, not degraded, never built (discord-notify-wiring 92 to 28); the YaE mirror still tells the public Cattery is phase-one, no-payments, when Stripe Connect escrow has been live since 2026-06-30 (brand-consistency 95 to 58); and 14+ first-person-collective 'we/our' instances survived the recent voice pass entirely because the audit's own pattern list only checks that phrasing in changelog prose, never in the live Terms/Privacy/About copy (ai-tell-concealment 83 to 46). Underneath the corrections, the money path itself still carries two real open risks: a Stripe webhook can be marked processed before its DB write is confirmed with no retry, and a breeder can flip a kitten's status while an escrow deposit is still held on it, closing a race a second buyer could exploit (now escalated to HIGH). Eleven commits since the last review went entirely into hardening and correctness, not one of the six launch gates in LAUNCH-CHECKLIST.md moved, and that gap is now its own strategic finding.",
